		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Kinco HMI Green GL (Basic) GL150E, 15 inch 1024 x 768 operator panel. The terminals are the power plug, the DB9 pins of the COM ports (pin number and signal), Ethernet and the USB ports; the pinout comes from the GL070E manual, check it against the datasheet of your model.</elementInformation>
